SUMMARY:Come Home to St. Mike’s Alumni Reunion: June 19 and 20\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:Whether you graduated five years ago or fifty\, Reunion is your chance to reconnect and remember the moments that made St. Mike’s feel like home. We are delighted to welcome all alumni\, especially those in years ending in 1 or 6. We are also honoured to celebrate the Class of 7T6 on their 50th anniversary.
